  <Placemark>
   <name>Small Craft Advisory issued October 31 at 4:24AM AKDT until November 1 at 4:00AM AKST by NWS Anchorage AK</name>
   <styleUrl>#sev_minor</styleUrl>
   <Style>
    <BalloonStyle />
   </Style>
   <Snippet>Coastal Waters Forecast for the Northern Gulf of Alaska Coast
up to 100 nm out including Kodiak Island and Cook Inlet.

Wind forecasts reflect the predominant speed and direction
expected. Sea forecasts represent an average of the highest
one-third of the combined wind wave and swell height.

.TODAY...S wind 20 kt. Seas 10 ft. Rain showers. Isolated
thunderstorms.
.TONIGHT...Variable wind 10 kt. Seas 8 ft. Isolated thunderstorms.
.SUN...E wind 20 kt. Seas 7 ft. Isolated thunderstorms.
.SUN NIGHT...E wind 15 kt. Seas 6 ft.
.MON...SE wind 35 kt. Seas 11 ft.
.TUE...E wind 40 kt. Seas 21 ft.
.WED...SE wind 25 kt. Seas 17 ft.</Snippet>
