   <name>Small Craft Advisory issued October 31 at 7:52AM EDT until October 31 at 12:00PM EDT by NWS Gray ME</name>
   <styleUrl>#sev_minor</styleUrl>
   <Style>
    <BalloonStyle />
   </Style>
   <Snippet>* WHAT...Northwest winds 10 to 20 kt with gusts up to 25 kt and
seas 2 to 5 ft.

* WHERE...Coastal Waters from Stonington, ME to Port Clyde, ME
out 25 NM, Coastal Waters from Port Clyde, ME to Cape
Elizabeth, ME out 25 NM and Coastal Waters from Cape
Elizabeth, ME to Merrimack River, MA out 25 NM.

* WHEN...Until noon EDT today.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.</Snippet>
