La Plata River Below Redmesa affecting San Juan County.

* WHAT...Flooding caused by excessive rainfall is expected.

* WHERE...La Plata River below Redmesa.

* WHEN...Rises on the river are expected to begin Sunday night and
last through Tuesday evening.

* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...
- At 11:30 AM MDT Friday the stage was 4.5 feet.
- Bankfull stage is 8.0 feet.
- Forecast...The river will fall to 4.4 feet late tomorrow morning.
